   <p>We the undersigned Jurors who tried the case of <persName ref="cwgk:N00005830">William R. Banks</persName> at the late term of the <orgName ref="cwgk:O001000">Jefferson Circuit Court</orgName> do recommend the <persName ref="cwgk:N001000">Governor's</persName> pardon to be extended to him -- </p>
<p><hi><persName ref="cwgk:N00002686">John Price</persName></hi>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00010879">John Downing Jr</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N002020">Samuel Ingrens</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00016367">Ra <unclear>Varens</unclear></persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00016368">P. T. Wood</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00016369">F B Green</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00016357">Henry Wehmhott</persName> 
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00016370">Joseph Werne</persName></p>
  </body>
